Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.30,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.59,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.81,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在这里结束吗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.05,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}这绝非你所愿吧
