Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:52.01,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}至少在一生中有那么几次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:56.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}想做个正直的当事者
